  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PRONI Centre Croatia yout</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PRONI ungdomsverk.kroatie</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PRONI Cener, Osijek/Vukovar in Croatia, has since 1997 received support through Swedish Proni-J&#xf6;nk&#xf6;ping for the training of youth leaders via J&#xf6;nk&#xf6;ping University and management of youth centers, clubs and activities. This year they receive direct support from Sida.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PRONI Center &#xe4;r en frist&#xe5;ende organisation i Kroatien som f&#xe5;tt st&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n Sida genom Proni-J&#xf6;nk&#xf6;ping sedan 1997 f&#xf6;r att utbilda ungdomar p&#xe5; universitetsniv&#xe5; till ungdomsledare och f&#xf6;r att driva  ungdomscenter/klubbar/aktiviteter. 2004 blir f&#xf6;rsta &#xe5;ret som de f&#xe5;r direktst&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n Sida.</narrative>
  </description>
